The "Cannot use a closed database" error in `supervisor.ts` is caused by a **teardown race condition** where asynchronous code continues to access the SQLite database after `dispose()` has been called. The 5-attempt retry loop in `observability-sqlite.ts` masks this bug by eventually succeeding when tests run under `bun --bun vitest` (slower teardown), but manifests as failures under Node vitest (faster teardown).

