|------|----------|------------|
| Over-aggressive JSON extraction could corrupt valid output | MEDIUM | Test with valid JSON, fenced JSON, and prose-wrapped JSON |
| Schema change to events may break existing queries | LOW | `event_json` is JSON-first—new fields are additive |
| Normalization could hide model instruction drift | LOW | Log both raw and normalized in debug events |

