## Quick Reference — Which Tool to Use?

| Task | Tool |
|---|---|
| Initialize session + discover specialists | `specialist_init` |
| List available specialists | `list_specialists` |
| Run synchronously, wait for result | `use_specialist` |
| Start async, get job_id | `start_specialist` |
| Poll job events incrementally | `feed_specialist` |
| Continue a keep-alive session (next turn) | `resume_specialist` |
| Redirect a running job mid-stream | `steer_specialist` |
| Cancel a running job | `stop_specialist` |
| Check system health + background jobs | `specialist_status` |
| Multi-specialist parallel work (deprecated) | `run_parallel` (use `start_specialist` instead) |

